  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Brett samarbete p&#xe5; skatteomr&#xe5;det mellan Skatteverket och Botswana     Unified Revenue Services. Projektet omfattar kapacitetsutveckling     inom omr&#xe5;den som skatteadministration, tax gap och inkomstprognos,    skatterevision, datoriserad revision, stora skattebetalare och        personalfr&#xe5;gor.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Broad cooperation in the field of tax administration between the      Swedish Tax Agency and the Botswana Unified Revenue Service. The      project comprise capacity building in areas such as tax               administration; tax gap and revenue forecasting; tax audit;           computerized audit; large taxpayers; human resources; ICT and         business management.</narrative>
  </description>
